    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d391">

                <pb facs="0386" n="270" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg270"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 822.00/355.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent Hedian
                        to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Esmeraldas</hi></placeName>, [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1914-02-17T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1914-02-16T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Undated</hi></date><hi rendition="#italic">; received February 17,
                            1914</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Bombardment ceased with destruction three houses. Others damaged, no lives lost.
                    Rebel forces intrenched sand beach Coquito. <pb facs="0387" n="271"
                        xml:id="pg271"/> Few troops in city. Believe intelligent attack several
                    points would be success. Inhabitants neutral zone mile distant exposed to rain.
                    Many returning.</p>
                <closer>[Unsigned.] [<signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hedian</hi></signed>.]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
